Problem
Install iptables and block incoming port 6300 for everyone except LBR host.

Solution
bash
# Install iptables
sudo yum install iptables-services -y

# Allow LBR host only on port 6300
sudo iptables -A INPUT -p tcp --dport 6300 -s 10.244.240.75 -j ACCEPT
sudo iptables -A INPUT -p tcp --dport 6300 -j DROP

# Save rules to persist after reboot
sudo service iptables save
sudo systemctl enable iptables
